- **Ride Comfort:** Lags behind best rivals. Engine noise and road spray can be issues. Below average.
- **Cabin Noise:** Engine noise and road spray can be issues. Below average.
- **Shift Smoothness:** Manual gearbox can be notchy. Below average.
- **Steering Feel:** Described as having good feel. Average or slightly above for a van.
- **ADAS Score:** Includes features like AEB, Lane Keep Assist, Intelligent Speed Assist, Driver Attention Alert, High Beam Assist, Auto Lights, ESP, Hill Start Assist, Rear Parking Sensors. Some models can have Level 2 autonomy features. This is good for a commercial vehicle.
- **Visibility:** Good forward/side, but A-pillar can create a blind spot. Rear visibility poor without cameras. Overall average.
